docs {
  # AcademicService.GetStructure

  Levels (cycles, areas, programs) with their grades

  `/ltedu.academic.v1.AcademicService/GetStructure` · unary · `ltedu/academic/v1/academic.proto`

  ## Request — `GetStructureRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `GetStructureResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `context` | `AcademicContext` |  |
  | `levels` | `repeated Level` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `AcademicContext`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `institution_name` | `string` |  |
  | `institution_kind` | `string` | ebr \| eba \| ebe \| cepre \| institute |
  | `vocabulary` | `Vocabulary` |  |
  | `period_kind` | `string` | school_year \| promotional \| cycle \| semester |
  | `term_schemes` | `repeated string` |  |
  | `has_grades` | `bool` |  |
  | `uses_attention_modes` | `bool` |  |
  | `uses_seasons` | `bool` |  |
  | `uses_formative_levels` | `bool` |  |
  | `single_active_period` | `bool` |  |
  | `can_manage` | `bool` |  |
  | `settings` | `Settings` |  |

  ### `Vocabulary`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `level` | `string` |  |
  | `levels` | `string` |  |
  | `grade` | `string` | Empty when the kind has no grades (CEPRE) |
  | `grades` | `string` |  |
  | `section` | `string` |  |
  | `sections` | `string` |  |
  | `period` | `string` |  |
  | `periods` | `string` |  |

  ### `Settings`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `term_scheme` | `string` | bimester \| trimester \| semester \| none |
  | `grading_scale` | `string` | literal \| vigesimal \| score (fixed by the institution kind) |
  | `passing_grade` | `optional int32` |  |
  | `conduct_grade` | `bool` |  |
  | `attention_modes` | `repeated string` | in_person \| blended \| distance (EBA) |
  | `shifts` | `repeated string` | morning \| afternoon \| evening |
  | `week_days` | `repeated int32` | Teaching days, 1 = Monday … 7 = Sunday |
  | `late_after_minutes` | `int32` | Attendance: minutes of tolerance after the first class, and the absence share (%) that raises an alert |
  | `absence_limit_percent` | `int32` |  |
  | `dre` | `optional string` | Official data for the report card; unset on an update keeps what is stored. Logo: image data URL (PNG, JPG, WebP or SVG, under 100 KB), "" removes it |
  | `ugel` | `optional string` |  |
  | `modular_code` | `optional string` |  |
  | `logo` | `optional string` |  |
  | `management` | `optional string` | Tipo de gestión: public (no tuition; families pay the enrollment and the APAFA fee) \| private. Unset on an update keeps what is stored; turning public fails while open periods still have tuition in plans or owed |

